1
00:00:35,760 --> 00:00:37,000
Dodging would give me away

2
00:00:37,760 --> 00:00:38,240
Only

3
00:00:44,120 --> 00:00:45,000
Zhi'an

4
00:00:46,600 --> 00:00:47,200
Zhi'an

5
00:00:47,600 --> 00:00:47,960
Who's there

6
00:00:47,960 --> 00:00:48,800
It's me, it's me

7
00:00:48,800 --> 00:00:49,560
Who is it

8
00:00:49,560 --> 00:00:50,080
It's me

9
00:00:50,840 --> 00:00:51,920
My lord

10
00:00:54,400 --> 00:00:56,240
I just wanted to take a walk outside

11
00:00:56,640 --> 00:00:57,840
But then I got lost

12
00:00:57,840 --> 00:01:00,400
My hand... my hand hurts so much

13
00:01:01,120 --> 00:01:02,080
I know, I know

14
00:01:02,240 --> 00:01:03,280
Let me take you to get treated

15
00:01:10,800 --> 00:01:13,800
This Li Zhi'an was sneaking around first

16
00:01:14,080 --> 00:01:16,040
Even if she died, she deserved it

17
00:01:16,800 --> 00:01:19,840
And these protective charms are suspicious

18
00:01:20,280 --> 00:01:22,400
I don't know why the Seventh Prince trusts her

19
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:39,200
My lord

20
00:01:42,280 --> 00:01:43,320
I'm afraid of pain

21
00:01:43,320 --> 00:01:44,400
Be gentle

22
00:01:44,600 --> 00:01:45,320
Alright

23
00:02:02,320 --> 00:02:03,160
You couldn't see it

24
00:02:03,160 --> 00:02:05,440
From now on you must take Huamei with you when going out

25
00:02:05,440 --> 00:02:07,640
I don't want to see you get hurt again

26
00:02:11,160 --> 00:02:11,960
Okay

27
00:02:12,360 --> 00:02:14,520
Husband, what were you doing just now?

28
00:02:15,040 --> 00:02:16,400
Why were you so alert?

29
00:02:16,920 --> 00:02:18,240
As soon as I approached

30
00:02:18,680 --> 00:02:20,440
Sharp weapons suddenly flew out from inside

31
00:02:21,520 --> 00:02:24,520
Oh, just handling some official business

32
00:02:24,520 --> 00:02:26,040
The guards were being overly cautious

33
00:02:27,120 --> 00:02:28,080
So that's what it was

34
00:02:28,800 --> 00:02:30,520
My husband cares so much for the people

35
00:02:30,520 --> 00:02:32,200
It's truly a blessing for the citizens

36
00:02:32,840 --> 00:02:35,560
But husband, you work late every night

37
00:02:36,320 --> 00:02:38,200
You should also take care of your health

38
00:02:39,080 --> 00:02:39,880
Understood

39
00:02:41,800 --> 00:02:42,600
Zhi'an

40
00:02:43,240 --> 00:02:45,320
While handling official matters today

41
00:02:46,000 --> 00:02:47,560
There's something I'd like to discuss with you

42
00:02:48,240 --> 00:02:49,680
Perhaps you might have some fresh insights

43
00:02:51,160 --> 00:02:52,480
My husband, please speak freely

44
00:02:52,840 --> 00:02:54,600
If there's anything I can assist with

45
00:02:55,120 --> 00:02:56,480
I'll share everything I know

46
00:02:57,560 --> 00:02:59,960
There was an old man in the north whose wife and daughter were murdered

47
00:03:00,120 --> 00:03:01,360
He endured humiliation and hardship

48
00:03:01,920 --> 00:03:05,680
Working his way up from laborer to accountant in the killer's household

49
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:11,080
He lived in constant fear for ten long years

50
00:03:11,640 --> 00:03:14,000
Until he finally discovered

51
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:15,920
Evidence of the killer's military grain trafficking

52
00:03:17,240 --> 00:03:18,800
What puzzles me is

53
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:21,760
When he had chances to get close to the murderer

54
00:03:22,360 --> 00:03:24,120
Why didn't he choose direct revenge?

55
00:03:25,440 --> 00:03:26,240
Zhi'an

56
00:03:30,240 --> 00:03:31,080
If...

57
00:03:32,680 --> 00:03:34,680
If your family were harmed

58
00:03:35,000 --> 00:03:37,760
Would you choose immediate vengeance

59
00:03:37,760 --> 00:03:38,800
An eye for an eye

60
00:03:39,480 --> 00:03:40,800
Or would you endure humiliation patiently?

61
00:03:44,200 --> 00:03:45,320
If it were me

62
00:03:46,120 --> 00:03:48,320
I wouldn't seek direct revenge either

63
00:03:49,280 --> 00:03:52,320
Wouldn't that just mean trading one life for another?

64
00:03:53,080 --> 00:03:55,600
Then the family's protection would lose its meaning

65
00:03:56,960 --> 00:04:00,400
I will definitely overturn the killer's entire plan

66
00:04:01,280 --> 00:04:03,760
And expose his true nature to the world

67
00:04:04,840 --> 00:04:05,680
Only then

68
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,640
Can he understand the survivors' suffering

69
00:04:09,880 --> 00:04:13,560
And I will also seek justice for my Li family

70
00:04:15,680 --> 00:04:16,480
Of course

71
00:04:18,800 --> 00:04:21,480
With a husband like you who can distinguish right from wrong

72
00:04:21,840 --> 00:04:24,720
You will surely bring justice to wives, daughters and elders

73
00:04:31,440 --> 00:04:32,480
What's wrong with him?

74
00:04:33,160 --> 00:04:35,160
Looks like he's having an episode from that Five Minerals Powder addiction

75
00:04:35,880 --> 00:04:38,040
Zhi'an, have someone prepare a bath

76
00:04:40,920 --> 00:04:41,720
Huamei

77
00:04:42,440 --> 00:04:43,920
Huamei

78
00:05:01,640 --> 00:05:05,080
A royal descendant indulging in such harmful substances

79
00:05:05,760 --> 00:05:06,880
Showing such lack of self-respect

80
00:05:07,120 --> 00:05:08,520
He's getting what he deserves

81
00:05:28,840 --> 00:05:30,080
Zhi'an

82
00:05:30,440 --> 00:05:33,000
Husband, you called for me?

83
00:05:37,760 --> 00:05:40,480
Husband, are you feeling unwell again?

84
00:05:42,920 --> 00:05:43,720
It's nothing

85
00:05:44,960 --> 00:05:45,960
I'm already better

86
00:05:48,120 --> 00:05:49,120
That's good then

87
00:05:54,320 --> 00:05:55,360
According to the timeline

88
00:05:55,560 --> 00:05:57,400
The Western Envoy will arrive soon

89
00:05:57,880 --> 00:06:00,560
I wonder what Zhu Huaijin plans to do with those letters

90
00:06:00,880 --> 00:06:03,160
Will he expose Zhu Huaichen in court?

91
00:06:14,280 --> 00:06:15,120
Steward Duan

92
00:06:16,880 --> 00:06:19,160
I heard last night that the princess consort was injured

93
00:06:19,600 --> 00:06:20,680
But seeing you today

94
00:06:21,280 --> 00:06:23,080
you appear perfectly fine

95
00:06:24,360 --> 00:06:26,040
Thank you for your concern, Steward Duan

96
00:06:26,600 --> 00:06:28,360
My husband took meticulous care of me last night

97
00:06:28,560 --> 00:06:30,000
So naturally I'm unharmed

98
00:06:32,160 --> 00:06:33,760
The princess consort is new to the manor

99
00:06:33,840 --> 00:06:35,120
and unfamiliar with the rules

100
00:06:35,200 --> 00:06:37,480
That's why she got hurt wandering around

101
00:06:37,960 --> 00:06:39,960
I came specifically to inform the princess consort today

102
00:06:40,240 --> 00:06:41,480
In the prince's manor

103
00:06:41,720 --> 00:06:44,080
one must behave properly during the day

104
00:06:44,120 --> 00:06:46,800
and absolutely no wandering about at night

105
00:06:47,080 --> 00:06:48,760
Steward Duan certainly throws his weight around

106
00:06:49,400 --> 00:06:50,720
Being so particular about rules

107
00:06:50,760 --> 00:06:52,320
You don't seem at all like the rumors say

108
00:06:52,480 --> 00:06:55,080
someone who rose through underhanded means

109
00:07:05,720 --> 00:07:07,560
You were definitely faking it last night

110
00:07:07,560 --> 00:07:08,480
You can clearly see

111
00:07:08,480 --> 00:07:09,440
So what?

112
00:07:09,520 --> 00:07:10,320
It's just

113
00:07:10,320 --> 00:07:12,640
some playful interaction between me and my husband

114
00:07:14,920 --> 00:07:16,760
Instead of scheming against my husband

115
00:07:17,760 --> 00:07:21,760
you should pay more attention to the Seventh Prince

116
00:07:22,680 --> 00:07:25,600
Why are you suddenly bringing up the Seventh Prince?

117
00:07:26,920 --> 00:07:28,480
I'm just looking out for you

118
00:07:29,680 --> 00:07:32,480
You might even get an official title

119
00:07:33,760 --> 00:07:34,480
You!

120
00:07:35,520 --> 00:07:37,200
Why so quiet now?

121
00:07:37,880 --> 00:07:41,080
Could it be the Seventh Prince already rejected you?

122
00:07:43,000 --> 00:07:44,200
Of course not!

123
00:07:44,840 --> 00:07:46,680
When I was trapped in dire straits

124
00:07:46,960 --> 00:07:48,520
it was the Seventh Prince who saved me

125
00:07:49,080 --> 00:07:50,200
I remember

126
00:07:50,320 --> 00:07:52,920
it was Zhu Huaichen who rescued Duan Yurou from the brothel

127
00:07:53,040 --> 00:07:54,600
How did it become Zhu Huaijin?

128
00:07:56,080 --> 00:07:59,000
You there, escort the princess consort to change her clothes immediately

129
00:07:59,120 --> 00:08:02,000
The Third Prince will take her to the Imperial Ancestral Temple for blessings this afternoon

130
00:08:02,240 --> 00:08:03,080
Do you hear me?

131
00:08:03,560 --> 00:08:04,360
Yes

132
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:09,840
So in this life, it was Zhu Huaijin who saved Duan Yurou

133
00:08:10,320 --> 00:08:12,280
That's why she's under his influence

134
00:08:12,680 --> 00:08:17,440
I wonder what other changes this temple visit will bring
